{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"torch-compile-guards-recompile","content_sha256":"sha256:51de8ab453e1a1aee3262562dad8377b64c339192fa5ada6aea9135e73a05f0b","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789925891.569841,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"Dynamo 按 guard(含形状)缓存编译；形状多变会频繁 recompile。用动态形状标注或分桶 padding 稳定输入形状可复用编译产物，避免抖动。也需注意 graph break。","id":"q-op-torch-compile-dynamic-shape-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"输入形状(batch/序列长度)频繁变化触发 guard 失效与重编译；对策是用 dynamic=True 或标记动态维度、对 batch/长度分桶(padding 到有限几个尺寸)以复用编译产物，减少重编译次数"},{"id":"b","text":"一定是显存不足"},{"id":"c","text":"是 GPU 温度过高"},{"id":"d","text":"torch.compile 从不重编译"}],"prompt":"torch.compile 的模型在推理中反复变慢、日志显示频繁重新编译，最可能的原因与对策？","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"torch.compile dynamic shapes","url":"https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/torch.compiler_dynamic_shapes.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"ai-compiler","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
